  "fullDescription": "This pack includes 14 forest-themed stamp brushes for the Procreate app.\n\nThe set features natural woodland elements such as oak tree, pine cone, oak branch with acorns, tree stump, leaf cluster, acorns, mushroom, oak leaf, fern leaf, forest bush, log, young oak sprout, and other nature-inspired forest details.\n\nAll elements are illustrated in a cohesive, soft style with clean shapes and balanced details, making them easy to combine into beautiful woodland and nature-themed compositions.\n\nThese Procreate doodle stamps are ideal for creating stickers, planner spreads, bullet journals, junk journals, digital scrapbooking layouts, nature illustrations, classroom materials, printable projects, forest-themed designs, and cozy woodland artwork.\n\nYOUR PURCHASE INCLUDES:\n\n14 Stamp Brushes (.brushset file)\n\nA complete set of 14 forest-themed stamp brushes designed for nature illustrations, woodland designs, planner stickers and digital stationery.\n\nThese stamps are not pressure sensitive and can be used with Apple Pencil, third-party stylus, or even your finger.\n\nYou can easily adjust the color, size, and opacity of each brush inside Procreate.\n\nCompatible with Procreate version 4.1 and above.\n\nHow to import:\n\nAfter downloading the files, open your Files app and double tap (or right-click) the .brushset file — it will automatically import into Procreate.",
